{"path":"experimental/ranges/concepts/Movable","title":"std::experimental::ranges::Movable","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::ranges::</span>Movable","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/concepts/Movable","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"The concept Movable<T> specifies that T is an object type that can moved (that is, it can be move constructed, move assigned, and lvalues of type T can be swapped).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/experimental/ranges/concepts\">&lt;experimental/ranges/concepts&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-ranges\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>concept <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> Movable <span class=\"sy1\">=</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_object\"><span class=\"kw493\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_object</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; MoveConstructible<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; Assignable<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>, T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; Swappable<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-ranges-ts t-mark-ts\">(ranges TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The concept <code>Movable&lt;T&gt;</code> specifies that <code>T</code> is an object type that can moved (that is, it can be move constructed, move assigned, and lvalues of type <code>T</code> can be swapped).\n</p><p>There need not be any subsumption relationship between <code>Movable&lt;T&gt;</code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_object\"><span class=\"kw493\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_object</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/concepts/Copyable\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>Copyable</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  specifies that an object of a type can be copied, moved, and swapped <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(concept)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/ranges","title":"Extensions for ranges"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::ranges::Movable","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. The concept Movable<T> specifies that T is an object type that can moved (that is, it can be move constructed, move…"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"Copyable","note":"specifies that an object of a type can be copied, moved, and swapped"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":79,"codeBlockCount":0}
